{"case_id": "m41", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Given:** a₁ = 7, d = 4, n = 25\n\n**Formula:**\n\n$$T_n = a_1 + (n-1)d$$\n\n**Substitution:**\n\n$$T_{25} = 7 + (25 - 1)(4)$$\n\n$$T_{25} = 7 + 24 \\times 4$$\n\n$$T_{25} = 7 + 96$$\n\n$$\\boxed{T_{25} = 103}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.299, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 445, "output_tokens": 235, "reasoning_tokens": 120, "cost_usd": 0.000677, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["ModelRun"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:57"}
{"case_id": "m44", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**16 + 8 + 4 + …**\n\nGeometric series:\n- $a = 16$\n- $r = \\dfrac{8}{16} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$\n\nSince $|r| < 1$, the series converges.\n\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r} = \\frac{16}{1 - \\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{16}{\\frac{1}{2}}$$\n\n$$\\boxed{S_\\infty = 32}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.935, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 440, "output_tokens": 255, "reasoning_tokens": 127, "cost_usd": 0.000613, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:30:58"}
