{"case_id": "m42", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "## Sum of the First 20 Terms of 3 + 7 + 11 + …\n\n**Identify the parameters:**\n\n$$a = 3, \\quad d = 7 - 3 = 4, \\quad n = 20$$\n\n**Use the formula for the sum of an arithmetic series:**\n\n$$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}\\left[2a + (n-1)d\\right]$$\n\n**Substitute:**\n\n$$S_{20} = \\frac{20}{2}\\left[2(3) + (20-1)(4)\\right]$$\n\n$$= 10\\left[6 + 76\\right]$$\n\n$$= 10 \\times 82$$\n\n$$\\boxed{S_{20} = 820}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 6.225, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 453, "output_tokens": 348, "reasoning_tokens": 164, "cost_usd": 0.000784, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["Reka"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:31:02"}
